Builds directory.rs without watchers, whose connections are channels the kernel's vfs doesn't
have (see entry_container.rs in scripts/kernel-cfg.py), and without the pseudo-directory entry
traits its vfs leaves out: the watcher field and the events sent to it are removed, and the
imports of what isn't built, including the tests' imports of watchers and of the FIDL endpoints
only the compiled-out fdio tests use. The watcher methods and tests are compiled out by cfgs.

(Applied by scripts/kernel-cfg.py; regenerate with scripts/kernel-patch-update.sh.)

